<description>&lt;p&gt;City councils are now handling over 600 tonnes of waste daily, most from Thongpiny, while a nurse was shot and wounded in a suspected revenge attack in Cueibet. Riek Machar said he took steps to prevent violence in Nasir and Ulang and traced years of bloodshed there, even as fishing-net disputes were cited as triggers of recent clashes in Nasir. A Kenyan preacher who urged followers to starve to death was sentenced to 200 years in prison, and the UN Security Council is weighing an Abyei mission mandate renewal ahead of a vote on December elections. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNZ1BSWHJMaG1uRFFnYU5TUUIwMS14bzlFVkxuR21razB5d2Ytc3pkckhNWWNXQjI5OW15OTkwZnFVd0tULXdCS3RIVTNiX1doSTZTNVRTMWFwYkdNWHp2dXhURUFWTTJGNUNlR3NNb2hrUXE5b1puWjV6MnVQdnp0d2V3akhWdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNRGhDTEJnYnJVNmNVaUFIdUxJc3BFSnRqZXFzQkxneWVvTXZqWnNOcDRyUkFUSmRkelphMFBGalRfMnJySFczdkZzNFRFc1JNaVQ3S2l6WHY1eEZVQ2VDelRScmZ2NlFRUlNsNFBpNjlyOFh5RlpnU3FlSi1zQWF4WWZZenRCYjcyMXR1clJzQ29xWlNhVkgxMHVzOWJWN2llbTQwZzk5SkxndVBQQkVFRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Confederation of Midwives&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNZEhBTlJnSmdvay1MYy00NUpjU29UbnowN0drZEsyYkFPNWY0M3BqQVNQbnJzYURXV2JHY282c1ZETEFmb244azVFeUVIMFlRQ013bzNCSnZWWW5iR01fZWVCNGZRejF4OTBPNks4aktpOEZHVF9MTG5ZempSVDVFTGxOUjN4TGw5eVFuQ1pQS1pkZzRwUHc0Nmd0NmM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot